			"type": "text",
			"text": "🧩 **Tool: check_doctor_availability**\n• Mid-call dynamic tool in `AssistantFunctions`\n• Triggered when caller asks about doctor hours\n• Executes: `POST http://localhost:8000/api/tools/call`",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"x": 220,
			"y": -320,
