			"id": "node-mcp-client",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "⚡ **MantraAssistBackendClient (HTTP)**\n• Executes: `GET http://localhost:5500/api/v1/providers/availability`\n• Automatically passes `org_id`, `date`, `doctor_name`\n• Fallback: Direct PostgreSQL `assist_db` query if API is down",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"x": 750,
			"y": -110,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "#ff7675"
		},
