			"type": "text",
			"text": "🗄️ **PostgreSQL (assist_db) via Prisma**\n• Queries `user_availability` and `appointments`\n• Computes open working hours in UTC (e.g. `\"14:00 - 15:00\"`)",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 240,
