			"text": "📦 **Standard JSON Response**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"providers\": [{\n    \"user_id\": 101,\n    \"name\": \"Dr. Ananya Sharma\",\n    \"available_slots\": [\"04:30 - 05:30\", \"06:00 - 07:00\"]\n  }]\n}\n```",
			"fontSize": 11,
