			"text": "💬 **Live Spoken Conversation**\n\n🗣️ **Caller (+91 77951 63421):**\n*\"Is Dr. Ananya Sharma available tomorrow for an appointment?\"*\n\n🤖 **Voice Agent:**\n*\"Dr. Ananya Sharma is available tomorrow, Tuesday, at 10:00 AM and 11:30 AM IST. Which time would you prefer?\"*",
